1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,933
Day twenty-four. I carry water up the
stairs. Floor ten. Floor twenty. The
dust of forty years comes off the
carpet, into my lungs.

2
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:13,733
Floor twenty-six. My hands go numb.
The inhaler has four puffs. I take
two. They don't work.

3
00:00:14,233 --> 00:00:17,600
I can't. I can't get up another floor.
Go on without me.

4
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:24,400
No. Wait where you said you'd be. I'm
not going to the top without you. Out
for four. In for two. Come on.
